{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Contend|strong=\"H7378\", LORD|strong=\"H3068\", with|strong=\"H3068\"those who|strong=\"H3068\"contend|strong=\"H7378\"with|strong=\"H3068\"me.  \nFight|strong=\"H3898\"against|strong=\"H3898\"those who|strong=\"H3068\"fight|strong=\"H3898\"against|strong=\"H3898\"me.   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"Take|strong=\"H2388\"hold|strong=\"H2388\"of|strong=\"H4043\"shield|strong=\"H4043\"and|strong=\"H6965\"buckler|strong=\"H4043\",  \nand|strong=\"H6965\"stand|strong=\"H6965\"up|strong=\"H6965\"for|strong=\"H6965\"my|strong=\"H6965\"help|strong=\"H5833\".   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"Brandish the|strong=\"H5462\"spear|strong=\"H2595\"and|strong=\"H5315\"block those|strong=\"H5315\"who|strong=\"H5315\"pursue|strong=\"H7291\"me|strong=\"H5315\".  \nTell my|strong=\"H7291\"soul|strong=\"H5315\", “I|strong=\"H5315\"am your|strong=\"H7291\"salvation|strong=\"H3444\".”   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"Let|strong=\"H5315\"those|strong=\"H5315\"who|strong=\"H5315\"seek|strong=\"H1245\"after|strong=\"H1245\"my|strong=\"H1245\"soul|strong=\"H5315\"be|strong=\"H5315\"disappointed and|strong=\"H5315\"brought|strong=\"H3637\"to|strong=\"H1245\"dishonor|strong=\"H3637\".  \nLet|strong=\"H5315\"those|strong=\"H5315\"who|strong=\"H5315\"plot|strong=\"H2803\"my|strong=\"H1245\"ruin|strong=\"H7451\"be|strong=\"H5315\"turned|strong=\"H5472\"back|strong=\"H5472\"and|strong=\"H5315\"confounded|strong=\"H3637\".   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"Let|strong=\"H1961\"them|strong=\"H6440\"be|strong=\"H1961\"as|strong=\"H1961\"chaff|strong=\"H4671\"before|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"wind|strong=\"H7307\",  \nthe|strong=\"H6440\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s angel|strong=\"H4397\"driving|strong=\"H1760\"them|strong=\"H6440\"on|strong=\"H3068\".   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"Let|strong=\"H1961\"their|strong=\"H3068\"way|strong=\"H1870\"be|strong=\"H1961\"dark|strong=\"H2822\"and|strong=\"H3068\"slippery|strong=\"H2519\",  \nthe|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"’s angel|strong=\"H4397